Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:03.59,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,So, so, so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:05.36,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Where did it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:07.03,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,It sure is cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:09.82,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What are you all up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:12.32,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Anna, look at this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:13.60,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:14.76,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:16.32,Class - Top,Claire,0,0,0,,Nice and smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:16.32,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,How long has it been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.55,0:00:19.08,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,For about a week or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:21.37,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Huh, I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:22.58,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Is it waiting here for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:29.29,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Is this... Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.09,0:00:35.01,sign_3812_25_Episode_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(776,1)}Episode 8
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:35.01,sign_789_15_Less_Than_Human,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,1)\pos(190.667,222.333)}Less Than Human
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:41.89,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I'm bored!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:44.64,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's dangerous, Cu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:49.27,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,What {\i1}was{\i0} that anyway, Parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.27,0:00:54.28,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You remember how they said \NI'll die if I use 15% of my strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:58.67,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So I figured I'd hone my fighting spirit \Non a regular basis, and keep a stockpile.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.67,0:00:59.87,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey, Blade...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:04.00,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It looks like this thing's \Nbeen looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:08.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Instant Dragon Eater!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.72,0:01:15.41,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.41,0:01:17.13,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Looks like I can fire off five more of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.13,0:01:18.74,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.74,0:01:20.71,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Why'd you suddenly send that thing flying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:22.47,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,My smooth friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:24.96,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Look, you have to destroy them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:26.34,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:27.60,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,The poor thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:30.19,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's been looking for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:31.51,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Don't you know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.51,0:01:32.84,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That thing's a Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:34.14,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,A Guardian?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.14,0:01:36.01,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.01,0:01:37.11,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Um, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.11,0:01:39.59,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Should I try and fix it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.59,0:01:40.64,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Just leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:43.32,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That thing can handle being \Nwrecked over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.79,0:01:45.58,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Ugh, this sucks, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:47.98,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Did it come up aboveground looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.63,0:02:00.51,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Is she an acquaintance of Blade's?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:05.39,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Will this body do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:07.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.97,0:02:10.15,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I have analyzed the human male psyche,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:14.15,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,and designed an appearance to \Narouse your protective instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:16.98,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hold on, who {\i1}are{\i0} you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.98,0:02:18.43,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Hey, Blade...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.43,0:02:20.41,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Do you think she's the one from yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:26.66,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Dragon Eater!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.17,0:02:33.47,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Dragon Eater! Dragon Eater! Dragon Eater!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:34.73,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Blade?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.73,0:02:35.88,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:36.70,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That's too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:37.76,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You're going overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:40.51,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Dragon Eater!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:47.96,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Phew, that was a close one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:49.94,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You lousy superorganism!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:51.39,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.39,0:02:52.31,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You're up against a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.31,0:02:53.31,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Don't you feel sorry for her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.63,0:02:55.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Why am {\i1}I{\i0} the bad guy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.81,0:02:57.91,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm sure that in no time...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:01.82,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,See? She's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.31,0:03:03.17,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.17,0:03:04.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:05.37,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:07.57,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Besides, I don't think she's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.57,0:03:09.46,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Are you sure she doesn't \Njust want to be friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:11.54,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:13.39,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Guardians are bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:15.96,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,If they go berserk, then even worse news!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:19.47,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I have received a command to eradicate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:23.11,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Currently, I am in \Nobservation mode to gather data.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.11,0:03:24.26,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,See, told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.26,0:03:25.07,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Hey, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.07,0:03:26.72,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Want to take classes with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:29.53,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,You are not an eradication target.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:31.92,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,However, stand in my way, \Nand I will eliminate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:35.56,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Furthermore, I am not programmed \Nto perform collaborative tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.79,0:03:38.78,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,In that case, you can learn how \Nto do that with everyone here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:40.38,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Well, Iona?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:41.82,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Iona?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:45.06,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,That says Iona in ancient writing,\N doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:48.11,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,This is not read as Iona, but 1-0-N-A.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.11,0:03:52.58,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,It is my identification and model number,\N and therefore, not my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:53.73,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.73,0:03:56.46,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,But if you don't have a name, \NI can call you Iona, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:04:01.61,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,It's just like Claire to come on so strongly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:06.18,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,And if you really want to defeat Blade...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:08.98,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,We can all come up with a plan together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.98,0:04:10.06,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Wait, why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.16,0:04:12.06,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,How does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.25,0:04:20.32,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Let us begin discussing \Nmethods to eradicate Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:21.95,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Hey, Iona...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:24.38,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Why Blade, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:25.45,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,That is because...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:28.95,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,he forcefully infiltrated my intimate zone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:33.46,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,desecrating my chassis repeatedly each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.99,0:04:35.63,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,That's awful, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:37.07,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.07,0:04:39.71,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,All I did was trespass on \Nthe area she was guarding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.71,0:04:42.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What's more, I had the master key, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.56,0:04:43.87,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I borrowed it from the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.87,0:04:45.18,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,That is insufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:49.35,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I also require biometric authentication \Nand a master code genetic signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:51.09,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.09,0:04:55.19,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,The Royal Library of Banned Books\N is underground near here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:58.23,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I had to drop in a bit to\N look up things about Asmodeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:04:59.24,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:02.08,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,So you mean it's because you were helping me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:05.14,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,There were 13 more instances \Nof trespassing prior to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.14,0:05:07.03,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It wasn't my fault at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.78,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I was destroyed 28 times in total...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:11.04,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade, that's way too many times!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:16.11,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,With my body being divided \Ninto 577,526 fragments...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.11,0:05:18.13,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade, that's way too many pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:23.08,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,And reprimanded by Mother, my supervisor, \Nfor 500,037,000 milliseconds...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:25.46,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Your boss lectures you for way too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:29.68,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,She attacked me first, so I had \Nno choice but to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.90,0:05:32.88,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Blade, you're so merciless!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:34.35,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Blade, that's way too mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.57,0:05:37.48,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Your heinous behavior sickens \Neven the Demon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.15,0:05:41.92,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:43.36,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,We made him sulk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:51.46,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:53.18,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Everyone's so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:57.35,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I only broke into the library because \Nof my duties as the Great Hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:05:59.38,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yes. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:03.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Besides, those things keep their \Nsouls in a separate location,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:05.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,so it's not like they die when \Nyou destroy their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:09.72,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,If they did die upon destruction, \Nwhat would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:13.32,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, I mean... I'd have to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:16.10,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm not the Great Hero now, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.72,0:06:18.35,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:22.80,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I believe this is the \Nreason why Iona can't win!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:27.11,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,You mean Blade is relentless because \Nshe doesn't die, even when destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.11,0:06:28.63,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Oh, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:29.96,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I could see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:35.09,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade can be so weirdly cold, \Nand downright scary at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:37.12,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,He even told me he'd cut me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.53,0:06:38.86,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Bragging, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:40.25,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I've got my share of stories, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:41.63,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,N-No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:44.32,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Never mind that. \NLet's be a little more constructive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:45.38,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Never mind that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:50.76,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I thin we should focus on ways\N to prevent your defeat for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:53.14,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,This is the result of my thought process.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:55.26,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Why did you decide to look like a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:07:00.85,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Upon observation, I determined \Nthat he treats women more gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:04.02,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,So you figured he'd go easy on you this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:09.78,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,That's adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:12.78,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,I want to adopt her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.55,0:07:12.78,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:13.20,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Iona.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:15.11,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I've come up with a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.11,0:07:16.29,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I call it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:18.79,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,the Stand Alone Complex!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.69,0:07:21.46,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Let me give a simple explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:26.41,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,We directly install Iona's soul \Nwithin the Core Unit in her heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.41,0:07:28.17,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,placing it in a state \Ncapable of being destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:30.05,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh? But if you do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:34.43,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Yes. Iona will cease to \Nbecome indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:38.45,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Would Blade take her down knowing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:47.17,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,You can do it, Parent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.39,0:07:49.19,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,Get him! Beat him to a bloody pulp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:49.86,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Iona! Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.86,0:07:52.91,Class- Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Go, go! Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.43,0:07:56.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get on with ti!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:07:57.61,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.61,0:07:59.32,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Let me tell you this first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:01.41,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Right now, I am in Stand Alone mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:03.71,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What? Stand Alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:08.46,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Presently, my connection to Mother \Nhas been physically severed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:11.53,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,That is to say, I am operating \Nfully independently,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:13.63,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,and cannot be repaired if I am destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:15.49,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh? Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:17.47,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Since your soul is in a different location...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:22.29,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,My weak point is currently right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:24.44,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey, there's no reason \Nto make him cop a feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:30.08,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Ten centimeters deep inside \Nlies my heart and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:32.07,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,If it sustains severe damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:35.53,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I as an individual unit will \Nforever cease to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:38.24,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Do you comprehend?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:39.87,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Now, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:43.34,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:54.55,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.93,0:09:00.31,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,What is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:01.89,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.89,0:09:02.68,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:06.02,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:20.96,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Wind pressure alone isn't gonna cut it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:21.74,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:45.31,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,The superorganism is grunting and groaning!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.55,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,She's not half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:51.95,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,It really looks like Blade \Ncan't lay a finger on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:54.65,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That smarts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:56.65,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have a bump now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:58.28,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Go a little easy, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:01.28,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Blade, you are the one who will go easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:06.41,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I already know it is not in your nature to \Nemploy violence against an innocent girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:10.83,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,You were defeated because your \Nattacks are too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.83,0:10:12.75,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:16.73,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You also didn't give me any chance \Nto use my less powerful moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:19.91,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Now then, please surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:22.55,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Or would you like to grunt \Nand groan some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:24.88,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I give, I give!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:26.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:30.66,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,She beat Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.66,0:10:32.94,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,How frustrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:33.63,Class - Top,Claire,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Iona!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.37,0:10:38.20,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.23,0:10:42.30,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Iona.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.35,0:10:54.59,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,V for victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:01.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You're not gonna eat it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:03.47,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Or wait, can you even eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:08.71,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I am equipped to break down and \Nabsorb organic matter as energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:09.73,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.61,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You're not feeling hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:15.99,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I believe she's lost motivation \Nafter defeating Blade, her target,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:18.32,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,resulting in burnout syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:20.74,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,But doesn't that only apply to humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:26.39,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,If I am met with a matter that \NI cannot resolve on my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.39,0:11:28.62,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,would it be best to discuss it with others?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:30.80,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,If you've got problems, tell us about them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.80,0:11:33.56,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,We're all your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:37.46,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,In times like these, I would always \Nturn to Mother for guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:39.63,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Who is this Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.63,0:11:41.91,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,She means the Mother Computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.91,0:11:43.95,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,The one who supervises Iona.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.95,0:11:46.43,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Whenever I complete a given command,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:49.93,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I report it to Mother and \Nam assigned my next mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.93,0:11:53.13,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,However, even though I have \Nrestored the connection,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:55.77,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Mother continues to refuse it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.91,0:12:00.85,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,For abandoning my duties, unilaterally \Nblocking the connection, and other reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:04.48,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,it seems that I have been declared a \Ndefective unit and my terminal login expunged.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.48,0:12:06.32,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,So you mean... you got fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:08.58,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What are these other reasons?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:12.89,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Transmitting around 15 terabytes' worth \Nof written abuse aimed at Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.89,0:12:14.21,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There's your reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:18.07,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I am feeling terribly insecure, \Nnow that I am without a supervisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.07,0:12:19.96,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Peek. Stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:21.14,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.14,0:12:23.13,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Can I call you Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.13,0:12:24.09,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.38,0:12:27.95,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You're asking me to take the \Nplace of your supervisor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:29.79,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,That is unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:33.36,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,If I do not have you become my master, \Nthe counter will keep ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:34.23,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Counter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.51,0:12:35.20,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:38.93,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,To prevent them turning berserker \Nwithout a chain of command,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.93,0:12:41.86,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,all Guardians have a \Nself-destruct program installed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:44.74,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:49.87,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,It looks like it decrements every second,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.87,0:12:52.75,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,which means we have a \Nlittle over 84 hours left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:54.16,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Do not fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.16,0:12:57.18,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,My intent is to self-destruct in a \Nlocation with no one else around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:12:58.88,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That's not the issue here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:00.83,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Ah, I get it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:04.63,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That counter should stop if I become \Nyour master or whatever, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.96,0:13:06.51,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Yes, most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:08.34,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'll do it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.34,0:13:10.01,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'll be your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.81,0:13:13.77,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.59,0:13:20.65,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Here you go, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:23.00,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Tonkatsu curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:25.65,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,By the way, what's with the getup?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:25.65,Class - Top,Cu,0,0,0,,It's so spicy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:28.69,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,It is an ancient attire for servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.21,0:13:31.74,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,If you command me to stop wearing it, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:34.08,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No, you don't have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:35.36,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I have received your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:37.72,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I will cease to stop wearing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:39.63,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,What is your next command?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:42.49,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's nice having you take care of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:44.63,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,but it feels like I've lost my freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.63,0:13:47.43,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,She provides us with food and snacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.43,0:13:48.89,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,That's a good thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:50.89,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:52.18,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:53.23,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:55.77,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,If you've got something to say,\N then you should say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:57.23,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Is that a command?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.23,0:13:59.09,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.09,0:14:00.63,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,That is not fair, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:04.44,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,You will not command me, \Nyet you do so for Miss Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:05.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.90,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Oh, is that a command?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:11.73,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.69,0:14:13.16,Class - Top,Cu,0,0,0,,Get off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.73,0:14:13.16,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What don't you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:15.12,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,She's stealing my character traits!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:16.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.53,0:14:18.34,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,She's stealing my character traits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.34,0:14:20.44,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,For one, my expressionless face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:22.61,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I am not expressionless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.61,0:14:25.64,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I have 800 different facial \Nexpressions installed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:27.84,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Also, how I wait for commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:29.20,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,That is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.20,0:14:31.64,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I am simply following my \Ninstincts as an android.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:33.04,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Stare...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:35.84,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You don't ever give me commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.84,0:14:38.57,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yet here you are, ordering Iona around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:39.90,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:44.56,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,In that case, let us see which of \Nus is more deserving of Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.56,0:14:45.90,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Eh? Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:47.76,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I've heard of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:50.12,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,This is what they call a scene of carnage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:51.82,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Let there be blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:55.32,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, \Nplease don't cause any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.32,0:14:56.83,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Is that a command?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:14:58.83,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.62,0:15:05.59,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:08.32,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No, don't give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:09.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.43,0:15:10.53,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Establishing my character.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.53,0:15:12.51,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Do you think I can beat Iona now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:13.98,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.98,0:15:15.97,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,It seems we both had the same idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.97,0:15:18.32,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Let us have a staring contest instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:20.00,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Just what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:21.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:28.36,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,An unarmed showdown?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:32.16,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,They couldn't settle the staring contest \Neven after a whole day had passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.03,0:15:35.37,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,It seems I will have to resort to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:37.87,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:42.96,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,This is supposed to be unarmed combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:44.75,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Both of you are disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:49.88,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Master. Which of us is more skilled?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.12,0:15:53.39,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pick the one that feels nicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.66,0:15:56.73,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I can't tell the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.35,0:15:58.89,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.19,0:16:01.64,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You're going to watch me as I'm fast asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.33,0:16:04.27,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What kind of showdown is this, even?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:10.00,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,The one to serve Master must be \Nsomeone who always puts you at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:11.44,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Go on, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.44,0:16:12.53,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Sleep like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.81,0:16:16.73,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm turning the lights off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:26.54,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Feel free to go to sleep if \Nyou are tired, Miss Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:29.03,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I've undergone sleep training.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:31.69,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I can keep going for up to seven days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.69,0:16:34.55,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I do not require sleep in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.63,0:16:40.64,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,It seems we will not decide \Na victor today, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:41.74,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.28,0:16:48.82,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Lately, I feel as though I would be \Nokay if we never settled this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.41,0:16:51.96,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I have always been alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:56.07,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Always alone, for such a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:59.58,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,He was the only one who would come visit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:01.94,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I was all alone as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:05.83,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,All alone in my cage in that dark lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.07,0:17:08.36,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I was nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.36,0:17:13.44,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,The single link I had was \Nmy worth as his replica.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:18.09,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I was able to stay linked with the \Nworld because he was there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.34,0:17:20.05,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That's how I felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:22.57,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I also felt the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:29.66,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,It seems that you have become \Nsomeone special to me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.66,0:17:30.94,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,What should I do about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.20,0:17:32.57,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.87,0:17:37.19,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,But this feeling when I compete against you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:39.37,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Am I having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:41.80,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I do not know the answer to that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.80,0:17:43.00,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Miss Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:44.54,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,As a human, you are better equipped to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:45.54,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.90,0:17:46.56,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:49.29,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Just call me Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.55,0:17:50.92,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,No title needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:55.52,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Understood, Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:04.71,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Good morning, Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:07.44,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Good morning, Iona.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:10.61,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Looks like you two are good friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.61,0:18:12.94,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Well? Are you having fun at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:14.94,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Yes. Very much so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:19.42,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Iona. Show me the counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.91,0:18:21.57,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Is that a command?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.89,0:18:23.83,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's right. Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.29,0:18:30.15,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's gone down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.15,0:18:30.96,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:33.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So it didn't work...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:36.55,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I would not say that \Nthere has been no effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:40.16,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,The progression of the counter has \Nslowed down to one-tenth the speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:41.47,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Let me take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.77,0:18:47.25,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I was afraid that a human as your master \Nwouldn't work, not even when it's a superorganism.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:49.69,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Looks like there's about 20 hours left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:52.69,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:55.46,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I would...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:04.25,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,If possible, until the last moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.25,0:19:08.25,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I would like to be with you \Nall for as long as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:09.88,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Iona...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:12.74,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,After that, I will go by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.74,0:19:16.25,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I do not wish to cause \Ninjury to anyone around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:24.47,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Let's get the "Send Iona Off \Nwith a Smile" party underway!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.76,0:19:31.98,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Is it all right for me to remain here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:33.21,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:36.36,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Everyone is trying to \Nmake your wish come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.08,0:19:39.76,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,So, Iona...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:42.99,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You should also enjoy this \Ntime as much as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.22,0:19:46.39,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't mean that as a command,\N but as your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:47.24,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:04.68,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.11,0:20:06.55,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Did you find that idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:11.18,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,We've looked all over the campus, \Nbut he's nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:15.19,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Where has that Blade gone \Noff to at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.81,0:20:24.95,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Iona!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.87,0:20:30.20,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.95,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I am destined to expire soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.95,0:20:37.36,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,What meaning is there in appending a \Nmeager amount of data to my memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:40.59,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,At first, I could not understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.59,0:20:43.60,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,However, after spending time with you all,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:48.98,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,in the moment before destruction, \NI see myself for the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.98,0:20:51.46,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,and feel as though I understand you humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:53.64,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:58.61,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I was less than human, but thanks to you,\N I was able to become human.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:03.63,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Please give Master my regards.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:05.53,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.53,0:21:08.30,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I still remember the warmth of your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:09.83,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Yessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.83,0:21:12.25,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I would have liked to have \Nmore girl talk with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:13.37,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.37,0:21:16.56,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I leave it to you to eradicate Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:17.49,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Cu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.49,0:21:20.13,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,It is fine to be mischievous,\N so please grow to be fine and mighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:25.63,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Finally, Earnest...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.64,0:21:31.17,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,The truth is that I am scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.98,0:21:33.27,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I do not want to go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.34,0:21:38.77,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:41.52,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Iona!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.52,0:21:42.44,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:43.94,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Do not forget me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:46.20,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Please, do not forget me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:47.25,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I won't forget you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.25,0:21:48.20,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,I won't, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:49.95,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I won't forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.95,0:21:52.58,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I won't forget you. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.36,0:21:54.46,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.90,0:21:56.21,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.17,0:22:03.98,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.08,0:22:06.80,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,She's not detonating.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:08.71,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.71,0:22:09.89,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,It should already be time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.31,0:22:16.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, this is where it leads?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.67,0:22:19.74,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.74,0:22:22.07,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,Wait, is there no food left for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:24.77,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.77,0:22:28.24,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,Where have you been this whole time, \Nskipping the party like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.24,0:22:30.40,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,Ah, I went to go see Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:31.03,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.84,0:22:32.94,Class - Top,Iona,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.94,0:22:37.26,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, you were gonna explode \Nbecause Mother fired you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.26,0:22:38.29,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.77,0:22:40.29,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,I went to go persuade her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.99,0:22:42.56,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,With a bit of brute force, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.67,0:22:48.49,Class - Top,Iona,0,0,0,,The connection with Mother has been restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.49,0:22:49.74,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.74,0:22:52.93,Class - Top,Iona,0,0,0,,Currently, the self-destruct program...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.45,0:22:55.31,Class - Top,Iona,0,0,0,,has met none of its parameters to activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:00.51,Class - Top,Iona,0,0,0,,Sophie, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.51,0:23:01.31,Class - Top,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.76,0:23:04.32,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,What you want most right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.32,0:23:06.14,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You should go and do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.32,0:23:10.20,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,If that was the case—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.20,0:23:11.32,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.49,0:23:13.83,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Master! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.16,0:23:15.33,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.33,0:23:16.18,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.18,0:23:18.42,Class - Top,Mao,0,0,0,,Well? Not going to stop her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.42,0:23:19.49,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,Just for today...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.49,0:23:21.33,Class - Top,Iona,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.63,0:23:24.21,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,Can't breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.21,0:23:25.46,Class - Top,Iona,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.46,0:23:27.46,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,I changed my mind after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:28.61,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.61,0:23:31.12,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,Get off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.51,0:23:39.98,sign_3812_25_Episode_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(528,1)\pos(433.333,124)}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.35,0:23:39.98,sign_33935_476_The_Superorganis,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(606,1)\pos(428.667,229)}The Superorganism Suppression Committee
